+#      envelope => REVIEW_ERROR phase=fix reason=fix_failed preserved.
+#   3. Missing/inconsistent pass artifacts   => strict.
+#   4. Claims code change, HEAD unmoved, no no-change assertion => strict.
+#   5. Explicit no-change resolution         => suppressed via detail Hash.
+#   6. The `fix_failed` marker path and the fallback envelope are mutually
